{
    "3": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah, what a bore."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Keeping secrets sure is a pain."
            ]
        },
        "116_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Heeey, Chiyari!"
            ]
        },
        "144_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Are you awake?"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I am, I am.",
                "Why're you bothering me at this hour?"
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "\"At this hour?\" What time do you think it is?"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Uh, what time is it?"
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "How am I supposed to tell from down here?"
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh, right."
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Whatever. Now's our big moment.",
                "Get your head in the game!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "4": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You mean, it's time for the decisive battle?"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, something like that.",
                "My enemies might come to mess with you."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So be ready."
            ]
        },
        "88_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh yeah, the decisive battle."
            ]
        },
        "96_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What a chore... but a promise is a promise, yeah?"
            ]
        }
    },
    "5": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hey, what's wrong with you?",
                "Did you overeat?"
            ]
        }
    },
    "6": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ugh, the light up here is way too bright.",
                "I'm better off without it."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But if the time has come, I've gotta get going."
            ]
        },
        "116_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah!"
            ]
        },
        "144_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's one of those chupacabras everyone's talking about!"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "She's gonna suck up my blood!",
                "I gotta get outta here!"
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Who're you calling a chupacabra!",
                "I'm a tenkajin!"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Tenkajin...",
                "Ummmmm...?"
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Tenkajin are youkai which suck up blood,",
                "you got that?!"
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Uh, um, it's one of them tenkajins.",
                "She's gonna suck up my blood! I gotta get outta here!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "7": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What even is a chupacabra?"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's some kind of blood-sucking youkai",
                "that's been super popular among humans lately."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A \"super popular blood-sucking youkai\"?",
                "Wait, that sounds kinda like me..."
            ]
        }
    },
    "8": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "She's gonna suck up my blood!",
                "I gotta get outta here!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "9": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ugh, I never should've left the Blood Pools..."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "How am I meant to make it all the way to New Hell?"
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "For some reason, the teleportation trap ",
                "I got doesn't work on me..."
            ]
        },
        "124_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh, we meet again."
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hello, little chupacabra!"
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah, you're that one from that staffing agency the other day!"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hey, everyone I've run into has started calling me",
                "a chupacabra. Is that on you?"
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's a good thing, no?",
                "It brings out your charms."
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You can also consider it payback for your stunt",
                "with that teleportation trap the other day."
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I got put through the wringer after that!"
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hahaha, serves you right."
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "People who spread around weird nicknames like you",
                "deserve to go to hell!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "10": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Whew, that felt good."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh my, you're stronger than you look.",
                "You seem more worthy of the name chupacabra each time we meet."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Uh, is \"chupacabra\" really such a high-class name?"
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Indeed, it's legendary."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, I guess it's fine then."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "By the way, you're heading to that one's place now, no?"
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That one...?"
            ]
        },
        "90_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Zanmu, that is.",
                "I can already guess you're one of her subordinates."
            ]
        }
    },
    "11": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I give, I give!",
                "I give up!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "12": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Let's see, let's see... If I wanna get to New Hell,",
                "I'll have to take the standard route."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The standard route was... pass the Children's Limbo, ",
                "cross the Sanzu River, go through Higan..."
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<i$Damn,> that's a hike!"
            ]
        },
        "124_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Huh?"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Chiyari?"
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Didja finally graduate from being a shut-in?",
                "That said, why would you come out here?"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "O-Orin..."
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You caught me in a bad spot here."
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So I gotta shut you up like anyone else!",
                "Hold a grudge forever if you must!"
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hell yeah, Chiyari's all fired up now!"
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Die!",
                "Die and fill up my cart!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "13": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Whew, I feel <i$alive!>"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I see... so you were pretending to be a member of Toutetsu's gang,",
                "but you've been working for Zanmu all along."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Are you headed to meet up with Zanmu now?"
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, I did promise her I would."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I was supposed to head over",
                "without anyone finding out about it."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're fine, you're fine!",
                "I won't tell anybody about this."
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "By the way, if you want to get into New Hell,",
                "you're gonna need a guide."
            ]
        },
        "90_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Could you help?"
            ]
        },
        "98_0": {
            "lines": [
                "No, there's no way I can guide you...",
                "But they've got a dedicated guide-gal, so you'll be okay."
            ]
        }
    },
    "14": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I see, you were pretending to be a member of Toutetsu's gang,",
                "but was working for Zanmu all along."
            ]
        }
    },
    "15": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hey-ooooo, guide-gaaaaal!"
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Come guide meeeeee!"
            ]
        },
        "116_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Welcome to Hell!"
            ]
        },
        "144_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah, if it isn't Miss Chiyari Tenkajin.",
                "Lady Zanmu told me to expect you."
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh, so you're the guide-gal.",
                "A Yomotsu-shikome character, right?"
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Yes, that is exactly right."
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hell always welcomes anyone. Without my guidance,",
                "you will never find the place you seek."
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Right, that's how it is.",
                "Lead me to where Master Zanmu's waiting then."
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hm hm hm, of course I will.",
                "But first..."
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "We must abide by the customs of Hell!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "16": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I will now be your guide."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If you are gonna guide me anyways,",
                "what was the point of that fight?"
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Please do not think poorly of me.",
                "This was also part of Lady Zanmu's orders."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh, I see."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Now then, I shall guide you as I was instructed."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hehehe.",
                "Please relax and enjoy your time in Hell."
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Huh?"
            ]
        }
    },
    "17": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Now then, I shall guide your way,",
                "to the depths of Hell..."
            ]
        }
    },
    "18": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's been ages since I've taken a trip this long..."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Come to think of it, ever since Former Hell was abandoned,",
                "I haven't left the Blood Pools even once."
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "This is actually pretty refreshing."
            ]
        },
        "124_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Whoa, who's there?"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So you're Chiyari Tenkajin.",
                "Chupacabra, what are you doing at my place?"
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Huh?",
                "A-Aren't you Suika Ibuki?!"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Were you expecting Zanmu?"
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Get a grip.",
                "Zanmu has thrown you away."
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Eh?"
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Because that's just the way that woman works."
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Zanmu throws people away when they stop being useful to her."
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's just like how she threw away Former Hell."
            ]
        },
        "216_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And because of that, everyone worships",
                "the ground she walks on."
            ]
        },
        "224_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That woman is a true oni among oni."
            ]
        },
        "232_0": {
            "lines": [
                "..."
            ]
        },
        "240_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well? Does it make you angry?",
                "Or are you grieving?"
            ]
        },
        "248_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hahaha, that's right.",
                "That's the kind of person Zanmu was, even back then."
            ]
        },
        "256_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Those who were left behind in Former Hell have been",
                "stewing in their resentment this whole time."
            ]
        },
        "264_0": {
            "lines": [
                "For someone like me who feeds on resentment,",
                "I can't help but be drawn to Zanmu."
            ]
        },
        "272_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hee-hee-hee-hee...",
                "Seems like I'm going to be disappointed."
            ]
        },
        "280_0": {
            "lines": [
                "To be an oni is to be a betrayer."
            ]
        },
        "288_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh well, let's enjoy Hell to our hearts' content.",
                "It's not like you can leave on your own!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "20": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Looks like you're having a hell of a time."
            ]
        }
    },
    "0": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Let's go!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Let's go!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "1": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's ridiculous to think you can beat me!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "2": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "This is frustrating..."
            ]
        }
    }
}